This plugin drives the Swiss TIP tooling (https://github.com/swisstip/swiss-tip),
which it installs from PyPI as swisstip-builder and swisstip-mcp. It contains
no copy of those packages.

skills/build-knowledge-base/scripts/replay.py is a derived work of
scripts/test/regression/run_regression.py of the Swiss TIP packs repository
(https://github.com/swisstip/swiss-tip-mvp), Apache-2.0, adapted to run against
a workspace instead of a repository checkout.

skills/build-knowledge-base/data/places/ch-register.json is built from the
register of municipalities of the Swiss Federal Statistical Office
(https://www.agvchapp.bfs.admin.ch/), a snapshot of 18 September 2026; it holds
official place names and codes only. ch-aliases.json holds hand-written
other-language names next to them. Municipalities merge, usually on 1 January;
refresh the register with "swisstip-places --output config/places/ch-register.json".

A knowledge release built with this plugin quotes excerpts of official
publications as cited evidence, with their source URLs and access times. Those
texts remain the property of their publishers and are not relicensed under the
Apache License. Consult the publishers' terms of use before redistributing a
release, and observe their crawling terms when acquiring pages.
